    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror game with a single run. The game does not have a save system. The challenge is to get to the end without getting a game over. The game has two types of weapons: rifle and pistol. Wear a vest to reduce the damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KNIFE: You can use knives to free yourself from enemies that can grab you in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ABOUT THE GAME: The game is in Portuguese-PTBr and English-En, with no audio dubbing. 3 (three) levels of graphic quality: low, medium and auto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not condone any drug use, sexual assault/non-consensual sex, BDSM, drug/alcohol abuse and/or self-harm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive until the end in a single attempt. If you fail, you will return to the beginning of the game over and over again. Do you think you can do it?</p>",
